{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50257","headline":"谢梁尊师见访不遇 · 李翔","name":"谢梁尊师见访不遇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓斸（斲）黄精昼未还（项云「斸」字不误，不必改。\n），岂知仙老降柴关。\n一声归鹤唳江口，数片白云遗竹间。\n怅望有惭劳羽驾，差池不得礼冰颜。\n秋风独倚书斋立，遥想真晖对暮山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李翔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50257.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50257","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}